    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="82cbeac7-1c30-5604-b553-8689024042b5" activityNameId="c5e85adc-a8b5-53b6-a845-e68271ecfd0e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Holzpur, softwood, raw, air, kiln dried, u=6%, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Holzpur, softwood, raw, air, kiln dried, u=6%, at plant
The economic allocation of the process to the two coproducts holzpur and industrial residue wood is done according to specific data on the volume shares and prices of the products. Data on the energy and material use are specific for the Walter Küng AG, which produces holzpur elements. The manufacturing plant is modelled by a sawmill.;
UUID: fab64652-dab5-33a1-add1-4194dc593866
Includes transport from the sawmill to the manufacturing plant and the manufacturing of holzpur elements from sawn timber.
Location: Data apply to the Walter Küng AG in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at the Walter Küng AG in Alpnach-Dorf (Switzerland). 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fab64652-dab5-33a1-add1-4194dc593866.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
